00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:45.840 align:start position:19%
As an update for the program, as many of
you probably know, Senate Bill 219, the

00:01:43.439 --> 00:01:50.720 align:start position:19%
Medical Psilocybin Act, was passed by
the New Mexico State Legislature and

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:57.280 align:start position:19%
signed into law by Governor Luhan Gisham
this past spring. The statute took

00:01:53.680 --> 00:02:02.479 align:start position:19%
effect on June 20th, 2025, and it
requires the Department of Health to

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:06.640 align:start position:19%
stand up the program by December 31st,
2027.

00:02:04.719 --> 00:02:10.640 align:start position:19%
