00:02:28.879 --> 00:02:36.160 align:start position:19%
conducted in person and some will be
virtual or hybrid.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:41.519 align:start position:19%
And by hybrid we mean they will be in
person with virtual options.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:47.440 align:start position:19%
The initial primary purpose of the board
is to create review and recommend rules,

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:52.560 align:start position:19%
regulations and protocols for the
structure and management of the program

00:02:49.519 --> 00:02:57.920 align:start position:19%
